# === 直连 DoH (oaifree)，否则 DoH 本身走了代理会解析失败 ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaifree.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,ld.ddd.oaifree.com,DIRECT

# End of LINUX DO rules - place this RULE-SET at the VERY TOP of your [Rule] section
